{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416114","formula":"C₁₀H₁₈O","hill":"C10H18O","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":18.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"(+/-)-4-terpineol","ru":"Терпинен-4-ол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Terpinen-4-ol is an isomer of terpineol with the chemical formula C10H18O. A primary constituent of tea tree oil, it is obtained as an extract from the leaves, branches, and bark of the \"tea tree\" Melaleuca alternifolia Cheel. Despite considerable basic and preliminary clinical research of terpinen-4-ol and tea tree oil, its biological properties and potential for clinical uses have not been established as of 2019. It may be a factor in the contact dermatitis of tea tree oil when used topically.","ru":"Терпинен-4-ол — органическое вещество, относится к классу терпенов. Содержится в лавандовом масле, скипидаре. Запах — пряный, земли, зелени."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":11230,"mass":154.25,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CCC(CC1)(C(C)C)O","inchikey":"WRYLYDPHFGVWKC-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"4-methyl-1-propan-2-ylcyclohex-3-en-1-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"11230","atoms":29,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.717,"y":-0.05,"z":1.461,"el":"O"},{"x":0.669,"y":0.004,"z":0.031,"el":"C"},{"x":2.111,"y":0.036,"z":-0.477,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.074,"y":-1.232,"z":-0.495,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.072,"y":1.291,"z":-0.372,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.522,"y":-1.287,"z":0.008,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.23,"y":0.043,"z":-0.042,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.565,"y":1.196,"z":-0.228,"el":"C"},{"x":2.849,"y":1.247,"z":0.086,"el":"C"},{"x":2.836,"y":-1.256,"z":-0.108,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.719,"y":0.006,"z":0.135,"el":"C"},{"x":2.117,"y":0.118,"z":-1.572,"el":"H"},{"x":0.395,"y":-2.163,"z":-0.161,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.068,"y":-1.234,"z":-1.593,"el":"H"},{"x":0.143,"y":1.555,"z":-1.414,"el":"H"},{"x":0.25,"y":2